"SuperGram.ChatUI.History.Appearance.Notice" = "Hide Reactions removes the reaction buttons under messages. Wide posts use the full screen width for channel posts. The share button next to a message is off by default: it sits right under your thumb and is easy to hit by accident. Changes apply to chats you open afterwards.";
