"SuperGram.Network.CachePresets" = "Aggressive Cache Presets";
"SuperGram.Network.CachePresets.Notice" = "Adds a 1 GB cache limit and a 1 hour \"Keep Media\" option to Data and Storage. They are only offered, never applied on their own. Picking them deletes partially downloaded videos, so a video you started watching may start over from the beginning. Requires a restart.";
